00:00:05.189 --> 00:00:08.259
THE LEFT.

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:09.493
&gt;&gt; Chris: THANK YOU.

00:00:08.392 --> 00:00:11.262
ONE OF PRESIDENT TRUMP’S TOP

00:00:09.627 --> 00:00:12.696
AIDES IS GONE TONIGHT.

00:00:11.395 --> 00:00:14.565
THERE ARE GROWING QUESTIONS

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:15.266
ABOUT HIS WHITE HOUSE CHIEF OF

00:00:14.698 --> 00:00:17.868
STAFF.

00:00:15.399 --> 00:00:19.270
STAFF SECRETARY ROB PORTER WHO

00:00:19.403 --> 00:00:21.472
