00:00:22.073 --> 00:00:26.577
TODAY CHIEF WHITE HOUSE

00:00:25.142 --> 00:00:30.681
CORRESPONDENT JOHN ROBERTS SPOKE

00:00:26.711 --> 00:00:32.683
