00:00:30.815 --> 00:00:34.185
&gt;&gt; THE WHITE HOUSE CONFIRMED

00:00:32.817 --> 00:00:36.854
STAFF SECRETARY ROB PORTER HAS

00:00:34.318 --> 00:00:38.856
