00:00:40.191 --> 00:00:44.662
AGAINST PORTER ON TUESDAY NIGHT.

00:00:40.959 --> 00:00:45.496
&gt;&gt; HE WAS SURPRISED.

00:00:44.796 --> 00:00:49.868
HE, LIKE MANY OF US, DID NOT SEE

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:51.503
THAT AND ROB PORTER.

00:00:51.636 --> 00:00:52.504
ALLEGATIONS HAVE BROUGHT

00:00:52.237 --> 00:00:54.873
FORWARD.

00:00:52.637 --> 00:00:55.473
HE WAS SURPRISED BY IT,

00:00:55.006 --> 00:00:59.077
DISHEARTENED, SADDENED.

00:00:55.607 --> 00:00:59.978
&gt;&gt; THAT SPOTLIGHT SHIFTED TO

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:01.947
SENIOR STAFF INCLUDING JOHN

00:01:00.111 --> 00:01:02.347
KELLY AND WHEN HE LEARNED OF THE

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:07.285
ALLEGATIONS.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:07.652
&gt;&gt; HE BECAME FULLY AWARE

00:01:07.419 --> 00:01:10.222
YESTERDAY.

00:01:07.786 --> 00:01:11.890
NOT GOING TO GET INTO SPECIFICS

00:01:10.822 --> 00:01:13.091
REGARDING WHO MAY HAVE KNOWN

00:01:12.023 --> 00:01:14.426
WHAT PIECES OF INFORMATION

00:01:13.225 --> 00:01:16.328
BECAUSE THEY WERE ALL PART OF AN

00:01:14.559 --> 00:01:18.196
ONGOING BACKGROUND CHECK

00:01:16.461 --> 00:01:19.865
INVESTIGATION.

00:01:18.330 --> 00:01:23.735
I THINK WE ALL BECAME AWARE OF

00:01:19.998 --> 00:01:26.104
THE NEWS REPORTS THAT EMERGED

00:01:23.869 --> 00:01:26.738
WEDNESDAY MORNING AND SOME OF

00:01:26.238 --> 00:01:28.607
THE GRAPHIC IMAGES.

00:01:26.872 --> 00:01:29.441
&gt;&gt; Reporter: DID HE KNOW ANY

00:01:28.741 --> 00:01:31.977
OF THIS IN NOVEMBER?

00:01:29.575 --> 00:01:32.344
&gt;&gt; NOT GOING TO GET INTO

00:01:32.111 --> 00:01:35.080
SPECIFICS.

00:01:32.478 --> 00:01:37.249
&gt;&gt; NOT GOING TO SAY WHEN KELLY

00:01:35.214 --> 00:01:38.484
OR OTHER STAFF BECAME AWARE OF

00:01:37.383 --> 00:01:39.485
THE ALLEGATIONS BUT COLBIE

00:01:38.617 --> 00:01:42.688
HOLDERNESS TOLD FOX NEWS SHE

00:01:39.618 --> 00:01:44.056
SPOKE TO THE FBI VOTED ON

00:01:42.821 --> 00:01:45.658
JANUARY 25, 2017, MORE THAN A

00:01:44.189 --> 00:01:48.861
YEAR AGO.

00:01:45.791 --> 00:01:52.465
AS PART OF A SECURITY CLEARANCE

00:01:48.994 --> 00:01:54.100
INVESTIGATION, SHE TOLD THE FBI

00:01:53.199 --> 00:01:56.002
ABOUT SEVERAL INCIDENTS OF

00:01:54.233 --> 00:01:58.871
ABUSE, INCLUDING VACATION IN

00:01:56.135 --> 00:02:01.674
FLORENCE, ITALY, WHERE SHE SAYS

00:01:59.005 --> 00:02:02.708
PORTER PUNCHED HER IN THE EYE.

00:02:01.807 --> 00:02:04.410
PORTER’S SECOND WIFE, JENNIFER

00:02:02.842 --> 00:02:05.211
WILLOUGHBY, SAID SHE SPOKE TO

00:02:04.544 --> 00:02:08.881
THE FBI.

00:02:05.344 --> 00:02:10.149
&gt;&gt; I TOLD THEM THE DETAILS OF MY

00:02:09.015 --> 00:02:12.051
MARRIAGE, INCLUDING VERBAL AND

00:02:10.283 --> 00:02:13.219
EMOTIONAL ABUSE AND INCLUDING AN

00:02:12.185 --> 00:02:13.786
INCIDENT WHEN HE PULLED ME OUT

00:02:13.353 --> 00:02:14.954
OF THE SHOWER.

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:17.490
THEY WERE MADE AWARE OF THE

00:02:15.088 --> 00:02:18.992
PROTECTIVE ORDER I SIGNED IN

00:02:17.623 --> 00:02:20.393
JUNE OF 2010.

00:02:19.125 --> 00:02:22.095
THEY WERE MADE AWARE OF ANOTHER

00:02:20.526 --> 00:02:23.429
TIME WHEN I HAD CALLED THE

00:02:22.228 --> 00:02:24.330
POLICE TO OUR HOME AFTER A

00:02:23.563 --> 00:02:28.568
DOMESTIC DISTURBANCE.

00:02:24.464 --> 00:02:32.105
&gt;&gt; THE WHITE HOUSE REPEATED

00:02:28.701 --> 00:02:34.274
PORTER’S DENIALS.

00:02:32.238 --> 00:02:35.508
SAID HE WAS NOT DENIED A

00:02:34.407 --> 00:02:37.110
SECURITY CLEARANCE.

00:02:35.642 --> 00:02:37.644
&gt;&gt; HIS BACKGROUND INVESTIGATION

00:02:37.243 --> 00:02:40.513
WAS ONGOING.

00:02:37.777 --> 00:02:41.281
HE WAS OPERATING ON AN INTERIM

00:02:40.647 --> 00:02:43.516
SECURITY CLEARANCE.

00:02:41.414 --> 00:02:44.918
HIS CLEARANCE WAS NEVER DENIED

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:45.986
AND HE RESIGNED.

00:02:45.051 --> 00:02:47.988
&gt;&gt; COLBIE HOLDERNESS TOLD

00:02:46.119 --> 00:02:48.955
FOX NEWS SHE HAD WARNED THE FBI

00:02:48.121 --> 00:02:50.290
PORTER COULD BE SUSCEPTIBLE TO

00:02:49.089 --> 00:02:50.624
BLACKMAIL BECAUSE OF HIS

00:02:50.424 --> 00:02:52.893
HISTORY.

00:02:50.757 --> 00:02:53.760
THE FACT THAT HE WAS BETTING

00:02:53.026 --> 00:02:55.696
MOST OF THE DOCUMENTS THAT

00:02:53.894 --> 00:02:58.098
LANDED ON THE PRESIDENT’S DESK

00:02:55.829 --> 00:02:58.899
WITHOUT A FULL SECURITY

00:02:58.231 --> 00:02:59.333
CLEARANCE RAISED EYEBROWS ON

00:02:59.032 --> 00:03:01.501
CAPITOL HILL.

00:02:59.466 --> 00:03:02.703
&gt;&gt; OPERATING A YEAR WITHOUT A

00:03:01.635 --> 00:03:04.505
SECURITY CLEARANCE, I DIDN’T

00:03:02.836 --> 00:03:04.905
UNDERSTAND THAT AND I STILL

00:03:04.638 --> 00:03:05.906
DON’T.

00:03:05.038 --> 00:03:07.908
WHAT GENERAL KELLY KNEW AND WHEN

00:03:06.039 --> 00:03:10.210
HE KNEW IT.

00:03:08.042 --> 00:03:11.879
&gt;&gt; THE WHITE HOUSE WON’T SAY

00:03:10.344 --> 00:03:13.113
WHEN CHIEF OF STAFF CALLIE FIRST

00:03:12.012 --> 00:03:14.348
LEARNED OF THE ALLEGATIONS,

00:03:13.247 --> 00:03:15.516
THERE WAS A DRAMATIC SHIFT

00:03:14.481 --> 00:03:16.016
BETWEEN WEDNESDAY AFTERNOON AND

00:03:15.649 --> 00:03:19.687
WEDNESDAY NIGHT.

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:21.322
IN THE AFTERNOON, KELLY PRAISED

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:22.189
PORTER, SAYING "ROB PORTER IS A

00:03:21.455 --> 00:03:24.025
MAN OF TRUE INTEGRITY AND HONOR.

00:03:22.323 --> 00:03:24.725
I CAN’T SAY ENOUGH GOOD THINGS

00:03:24.158 --> 00:03:27.395
ABOUT HIM.

00:03:24.859 --> 00:03:27.962
HE IS A FRIEND, A CONFIDANT, AND

00:03:27.528 --> 00:03:30.331
TRUSTED PROFESSIONAL.

00:03:28.095 --> 00:03:30.698
I AM PROUD TO SERVE ALONGSIDE

00:03:30.464 --> 00:03:32.834
HIM."

00:03:30.832 --> 00:03:34.468
THAT STATEMENT WAS CRAFTED BY A

00:03:32.967 --> 00:03:35.369
NUMBER OF WHITE HOUSE OFFICIALS

00:03:34.602 --> 00:03:36.170
INCLUDING COMMUNICATIONS

00:03:35.503 --> 00:03:38.472
DIRECTOR HOPE HICKS WHO IS

00:03:36.304 --> 00:03:38.873
ROMANTICALLY INVOLVED WITH

00:03:38.606 --> 00:03:41.476
PORTER.

00:03:39.006 --> 00:03:42.210
AFTER THE PHOTOS OF A BRUISED

00:03:41.609 --> 00:03:43.711
AND BATTERED COLBIE HOLDERNESS

00:03:42.343 --> 00:03:46.414
WENT PUBLIC, CHIEF OF STAFF DID

00:03:43.845 --> 00:03:48.149
A QUICK ABOUT-FACE, SAYING "I

00:03:46.547 --> 00:03:49.083
WAS SHOCKED BY THE NEW

00:03:48.282 --> 00:03:49.550
ALLEGATIONS RELEASED TODAY

00:03:49.217 --> 00:03:51.119
AGAINST PORTER.

00:03:49.684 --> 00:03:51.719
THERE IS NO PLACE FOR

00:03:51.252 --> 00:03:52.520
DOMESTIC VIOLENCE IN OUR

00:03:51.853 --> 00:03:54.222
SOCIETY.

00:03:52.654 --> 00:03:56.324
I STAND BY MY PREVIOUS COMMENTS

00:03:54.355 --> 00:03:57.725
OF THE ROB PORTER THAT I HAVE

00:03:56.457 --> 00:03:59.360
COME TO KNOW SINCE BECOMING

00:03:57.859 --> 00:04:00.595
CHIEF OF STAFF AND BELIEVE EVERY

00:03:59.494 --> 00:04:03.331
INDIVIDUAL DESERVES THE RIGHT TO

00:04:00.728 --> 00:04:06.167
DEFEND THEIR REPUTATION."

00:04:03.464 --> 00:04:06.935
THE WHITE HOUSE INSISTS IT TAKES

00:04:06.301 --> 00:04:07.736
ALLEGATIONS OF DOMESTIC ABUSE

00:04:07.068 --> 00:04:08.436
SERIOUSLY AND ACKNOWLEDGES

00:04:07.869 --> 00:04:11.806
WHITE HOUSE STAFF COULD HAVE

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:12.340
DONE A BETTER JOB IN RESPONDING

00:04:11.940 --> 00:04:17.312
TO THE REVELATIONS.

00:04:12.474 --> 00:04:20.482
WHITE HOUSE PRESS SECRETARY RAJ

00:04:17.445 --> 00:04:21.216
SHAH SAID HOPE HICKS RECUSED

